Youm, Hye Won; Feng, Zhe; London, Clare; Xiong, Yusheng; Tata, Jim;
Verras, Andreas; Garcia-Calvo, Margarita; Song, Xuelei; Addona, George
H.; McLaren, Dave G.; He, Timothy; Murphy, Beth; Metzger, Dan E.;
Salituro, Gino; Deckman, Diana; Chen, Qing; Jin, Xiaoling; Stout, Steven
J.; Wang, Sheng-Ping; Wilsie, Larissa; Palyha, Oksana; Han, Seongah;
Hubbard, Brian K.; Previs, Stephen F.; Pinto, Shirly; Taggart, Andrew
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
