$DATUM A mixture of
3-(7-bromo-4-methyl-3-oxo-2,3,4,10-tetrahydro-9-oxa-1,2,4a-triazaphenanthren-6-ylamino)-azetidine-1-carboxylic
acid tert-butyl ester (intermediate obtained at Step A during preparation
of compound 21, 1 g, 2.1 mmol), phenylboronic acid (0.79 g, 6.4 mmol),
1,1'-bis(diphenylphosphino)ferrocene-palladium(II)dichloride
dichloromethane complex (0.351 g, 0.43 mmol) and K2CO3 (0.890 g, 6.4
mmol) in dioxane (24 mL) and water (4 mL) was heated at 110 °C overnight.
The reaction mixture was cooled to ambient temperature and the solvent
was removed in vacuo to give the crude product, which was purified by
column chromatography (eluting with 10-40% EtOAc in petroleum ether).
3-(4-methyl-3-oxo-7-phenyl-2,3,4,10-tetrahydro-9-oxa-1,2,4a-triaza-phenanthren-6-ylamino)-azetidine-1-carboxylic
acid tert-butyl ester (racemate, 0.710 g, 71%) as an off-white solid.
